{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "61d69dff-d882-8255-b358-2622531b1511",
  "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:30:29-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rui Vieira",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T12:27:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. Buenas tardes, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T12:27:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. Yes. I need a certified copy of a birth certificate. For a passport."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T12:27:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can help with that. Whose birth certificate is it? Yours?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T12:28:02-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mine. [pause] Sorry. I'm chopping onions, my eyes are going."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T12:28:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time. Were you born here in Newport?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T12:28:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Born in Portugal. Well, no, wait. You're asking the wrong... I was born at the hospital here. Newport. Nineteen fifty-two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T12:28:21-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, born in Newport, 1952. Good, then we'd have the record. What's your full name as it would be on the certificate?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T12:28:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Rui Vieira. V-I-E-I-R-A. [sniffles] Rui is R-U-I."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T12:28:34-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Rui Vieira. And do you know your parents' names? We usually need the mother's maiden name."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T12:28:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. My mother was Maria Costa. Father was Antonio Vieira."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T12:28:47-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Now, you'll need to send a copy of a photo ID with the request, or you can come in and show it. Do you have a driver's license?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T12:28:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do. I can come in. I'm not far."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T12:29:03-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the quickest way. If you come to the counter with your license, we can usually process it while you wait or close to it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T12:29:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And if I mail it? How long does that take? The turnaround."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T12:29:19-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "By mail, figure a week or so, depending on the mail both ways. In person is much faster. Are you in a rush for the passport?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T12:29:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little. Travel in the spring. [sniffles] I'd rather get it done now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T12:29:36-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then I'd come in. We're open until four-thirty today, and you're good for tomorrow too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T12:29:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-thirty. Okay. Do I need an appointment?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T12:29:47-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No appointment. Just come to the City Clerk's counter at City Hall. Bring your license. There's a fee for each certified copy, and the counter will tell you the amount and what forms of payment they take."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T12:30:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. One copy is enough for the passport?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T12:30:06-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, one certified copy with the raised seal is what they ask for. Some people get two to keep a spare, up to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T12:30:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One is fine. [pause] Let me finish these onions and I'll come this afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T12:30:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good, Mr. Vieira. Muy bien. We'll see you later."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T12:30:27-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
